{"messages":[{"text":"🇪🇸 El Congreso decide hoy si tramita una ley de Vox para incluir la lucha contra la inmigración ilegal entre las operaciones de las Fuerzas Armadas. 🌶️ Abascal quiere que Defensa también tenga ventanilla de Extranjería.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20El%20Congreso%20decide%20hoy%20si%20tramita%20una%20ley%20de%20Vox%20para%20incluir%20la%20lucha%20contra%20la%20inmigraci%C3%B3n%20ilegal%20entre%20las%20operaciones%20de%20las%20Fuerzas%20Armadas.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Abascal%20quiere%20que%20Defensa%20tambi%C3%A9n%20tenga%20ventanilla%20de%20Extranjer%C3%ADa."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20El%20Congreso%20decide%20hoy%20si%20tramita%20una%20ley%20de%20Vox%20para%20incluir%20la%20lucha%20contra%20la%20inmigraci%C3%B3n%20ilegal%20entre%20las%20operaciones%20de%20las%20Fuerzas%20Armadas.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20De%20%C2%ABtodo%20por%20la%20patria%C2%BB%20a%20%C2%ABtodo%20por%20el%20padr%C3%B3n%C2%BB%2C%20en%20una%20proposici%C3%B3n%20de%20ley."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20El%20Congreso%20decide%20hoy%20si%20tramita%20una%20ley%20de%20Vox%20para%20incluir%20la%20lucha%20contra%20la%20inmigraci%C3%B3n%20ilegal%20entre%20las%20operaciones%20de%20las%20Fuerzas%20Armadas.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Vox%20ampl%C3%ADa%20el%20cat%C3%A1logo%20militar%3A%20tierra%2C%20mar%2C%20aire%20y%20ahora%20frontera%20migratoria."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20El%20Congreso%20decide%20hoy%20si%20tramita%20una%20ley%20de%20Vox%20para%20incluir%20la%20lucha%20contra%20la%20inmigraci%C3%B3n%20ilegal%20entre%20las%20operaciones%20de%20las%20Fuerzas%20Armadas.%20%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20Ej%C3%A9rcito%2C%20seg%C3%BAn%20Vox%3A%20defensa%20nacional%20y%2C%20de%20paso%2C%20control%